WEBVTT

00:02:59.244 --> 00:03:01.546
"Passion lives here."

00:03:02.987 --> 00:03:04.810
Isn't it always true?

00:03:04.834 --> 00:03:08.880
Heart is what drives us
and determines our fate.

00:03:08.904 --> 00:03:11.976
That is what I need
for my characters in my books:

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.561
a passionate heart.

00:03:14.331 --> 00:03:19.682
I need mavericks, dissidents,
adventurers, outsiders and rebels,

00:03:19.706 --> 00:03:23.555
who ask questions,
bend the rules and take risks.

00:03:23.579 --> 00:03:26.325
People like all of you in this room.

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:31.384
Nice people with common sense
do not make interesting characters.